            "answer_size_mobile": 13,
            "question_1": "How does the subscription work?",
            "answer_1": "<p>Choose how many bags you want and Subscribe & Save. Your first order ships at the first-order price, then renews automatically at the renew price on your chosen schedule. You can pause or cancel anytime before the next billing date.</p>",
            "question_2": "When will my order arrive?",
            "answer_2": "<p>Orders typically ship within 1–2 business days. Delivery time depends on your location and carrier. You’ll get tracking once your order ships.</p>",
            "question_3": "What is the return policy?",
            "answer_3": "<p>You’re covered by our 30-day money-back guarantee. If it’s not a fit, contact us within 30 days of delivery and we’ll help make it right.</p>",
            "question_4": "Can I pause or cancel anytime?",
            "answer_4": "<p>Yes. Manage your subscription anytime from your account or the link in your order emails, pause, skip, or cancel before your next renewal with no lock-in.</p>",
            "question_5": "Are the gifts really free?",
            "answer_5": "<p>Yes. Save-A-Scoop ships free with your first Bulk Bag order. The 3 digital guides are emailed after purchase (not shipped, and not re-sent on subscription renewals). The free black shaker is included on your first subscription order only. Intro pricing and welcome gifts are for new customers, once per customer.</p>"
          }
        },
