            "text_count": 3,
            "text_1_stars": 5,
            "text_1_title": "Worth every scoop",
            "text_1_body": "I stopped buying separate collagen and protein. One bag covers my morning and the price per serving feels fair for how clean it is.",
            "text_1_name": "Alicia K.",
            "text_2_stars": 5,
            "text_2_title": "Better value than stacking tubs",
            "text_2_body": "I used to spend more piecing together powders. Zeotein simplified my cart and my routine without cutting corners on quality.",
            "text_2_name": "Chris D.",
            "text_3_stars": 5,
            "text_3_title": "Gift kit sealed the deal",
            "text_3_body": "Between the first-order savings and the welcome kit, trying Cacao felt low-risk, and I kept the subscription.",
            "text_3_name": "Priya S.",
            "text_4_stars": 5,
            "text_4_title": "",
